From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: glacier <hyouga.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 08:29:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] 1.7 Lunar Client sees the world border and titles, through
 Apollo

A vanilla 1.7 client has neither, so the 1.7 translation dropped them. A client that registers
lunar:apollo now gets them as Apollo's lightweight JSON messages instead; plugins keep using
Bukkit's world border and titles. AthenaLegacy17Ui is the seam for other clients' APIs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

